{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2021-12-09 10:30:00', 'title': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. PLEDGES $1.4 MILLION IN CHARITABLE DONATIONS IN RECOGNITION OF 20TH ANNIVERSARY', 'text': "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. (NASDAQ: ACGL) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO DONATE $1.4 MILLION, DIRECTED BY EMPLOYEE VOTING, TO CHARITIES AROUND THE WORLD IN RECOGNITION OF THE 20TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE FIRM'S FOUNDING. THE GIFTS TO CHARITIES WERE ANNOUNCED BY FRANÇOIS MORIN, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF ARCH CAPITAL GROUP, AFTER COMPANY LEADERS RANG THE CLOSING BELL AT NASDAQ IN RECOGNITION OF ARCH'S ANNIVERSARY. THE CHARITABLE DONATIONS TARGET BROAD-BASED ORGANIZATIONS WI"}